      },
      "title": "Two ways to run",
      "description": "**How it works:** if the file is run directly with Bun (`Bun.main === import.meta.path`), it starts its own server on port 3001. Inside Next.js it's only imported, so this block is skipped.\n\n**Why it matters:** one file works both ways: as a route inside Next.js on Vercel, or as a standalone Bun server.\n\n**Watch out:** the banner below still says *KVLabs API Server*. KVLabs is the company name used across the code."
    },
